    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": " Edward Carey Property is delighted to present this fantastic family home superbly located in Rathcore village - in the heart of the County Meath countryside. This wonderful home, extending to a generous 247sq.m /2,658 sq.ft is ideal for the expanding family with a lovely country style feel to the kitchen/family room, the separate large formal sitting room, the 5th bedroom/home study option on the ground floor, and not to forget the large detached block built garage, and the property is not overlooked to the front or rear = all you see are fields in either direction!\n\nApproached by a tarmacaddamed driveway, with lovely wrought iron gates & front railings, and having large, but easily maintained gardens Rathcore could not be better. The area is super ? a short walk to the iconic Boggan's Bar with it?s beautiful thatched roof & traditional interior (the focal point of the area), Rathcore Golf Club, and the wonderful Rathcore Church, now a community hub.\n\nThe larger towns of Enfield, Trim & Longwood are all within easy reach and provide a full range of educational, shopping, transport & commercial activities & services. Enfield is a fantastic location with excellent bus & rail transport to the city, a wide range of shopping & entertainment venues, great restaurants, local primary school & several sports clubs all within easy reach. Viewing is a must. \n\nAre you bidding on one of our properties, new to the market, unsure of the procedure? Check out my website https;//www.edcarey.ie/useful-information/ for a helpful guide on buying & selling with us.\n\nTo bid on this property, please go to my website www.edcarey.ie, find the listing & hit the 'Offr' button to bring you to the registration field. I'll then approve your registration and you can bid at your convenience. \n\nOutside \nlarge block-built garage, tarmacaddamed driveway & large easily maintained front & rear gardens."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall (3.25m x 1.21m) with solid wood flooring, alarm keypad, ceiling coving, centre light fitting, attractive wooden staircase with useful under stairs storage.<br>Sitting Room (5.08m x 4.87m) formal front sitting room, with ceiling coving, open solid fuel fireplace, bay window to the front, centre light fitting, curtains included<br>Kitchen/Dining (8.16m x 84.23m) large family style kitchen/dining room with solid wood flooring, great range of fitted kitchen cabinets with the kitchen appliances included. Great island unit & pelmet included. Patio doors to the west facing decking area & double doors to the family/TV room<br>Utility Room large utility room/area with range of fitted kitchen cabinets, separate guest wc & whb, and useful storage closet<br>Family Room (5.37m x 5.27m) opening from the kitchen/dining room. Having solid wood flooring, bay window with curtains included, open solid fuel fireplace & built-in TV & shelving units<br>Bedroom 1 (3.75m x 3.68m) ground floor double bedroom with solid wood flooring, curtains included<br>Bathroom (2.68m x 2.06m) ground floor bathroom, fully tiled with wc, whb & shower<br>Landing (5.75m x 4.30m) with hot-press<br>Bedroom 2 (5.37m x 4.84m) large front double bedroom with laminate wood flooring, great range of built-in wardrobes, curtains included<br>Bedroom 3 (5.88m x 3.68m) front bedroom with laminate wood flooring<br>Bedroom 4 (3.63m x 3.53m) front double bedroom with solid wood flooring, range of built-in wardrobes, curtains included<br>Bedroom 5 (4.39m x 3.76m) rear double bedroom with solid wood flooring, built-in wardrobes, curtains included<br>En-suite (2.15m x 1.64m) en-suite bathroom, fully tiled with wc, whb & shower<br>Bathroom (3.16m x 2.34m) family bathroom, fully tiled, with bath, wc & whb"
      },
